  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support the Government of Armenia in modernization of Armenia&#x2019;s reservoir management capabilities and increasing the resilience of downstream communities by improving dam safety, modernizing hydrological and water flow monitoring, improving early warning and emergency preparedness and response capacities and introducing of renewable energy resources.</narrative>
